AB  - This research covers the main factors that are affecting the decision making of the Lebanese consumer, and his behavior when purchasing a product or a service online. The result asserts that Lebanese consumers have no trust, no confidence in online sites, faces difficulties when encountering website, perceived risk of internet purchase.
